<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">You &amp;amp; Me - Version 2 (Adora's POV)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra and Adora often discuss aspects of their past life during the Horde: they share many good memories and some not so good. For Adora, growing up in the Horde was difficult but when she meets her best friend things start to get better. Together Catra and Adora are unstoppable but through the years Adora starts to develop strong feelings for Catra and wasn't sure what they meant... turned out she was in love with Catra, even if she wasnâ€™t quite sure what love meant. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This series explores eight moments in Catra's and Adora past that lead up to the start of my fic: Together at the End of the World. This is version 2 of the prequel chapters under the same title: You &amp;amp; Me. Unlike the original version (which Iâ€™d highly recommend reading first), all chapters are written from Adora's POV rather than Catraâ€™s. Hope you enjoy.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Midnight_Owl2</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mature</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lonnie (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
